          <ul class="rc-minus-list">
            {poorFit.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <p class="rc-fit__aside">
            We would rather tell you that you do not need a large cleanup than sell you work you
            do not need. Not sure? Send photos.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rc-price">
        <div class="rc-price__copy">
          <h3 class="ac-type-h3-home-feature">We price the job we see.</h3>
          <p>
            A few visible droppings in one place can be a very different job from evidence across
            several rooms. There is no one price for rodent-droppings cleanup — send photos first,
            and we can usually tell you what needs to happen next.
          </p>
          <p class="rc-price__fee">{site.offer.assessmentFraming(site.offer.assessmentFee)}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-price__drivers">
